OL,5,G2100 Inside the Operating Theatre
OL,6,     FTrisha has an investigation of her
OL,7,     Fwomb to find out if she has
OL,8,     Fcancer, Steve's varicose veins are
OL,9,     Fstripped from his leg, and Dennis
OL,10,     Fneeds an operation to strengthen
OL,11,     Fhis eyelid.
OL,12,G2200 Emma Willis: Special Births
OL,13,     FEmma visits David and Hayley, who
OL,14,     Fspent three years trying to
OL,15,     Fconceive and eventually had twins,
OL,16,     Fand sets out to watch Fay's water
OL,17,     Fbirth - but things don't go
OL,18,     Faccording to plan.
